==History==
2023
*The Skeletons' Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 19/6/2023, in the [[Version History#Card Evolution Update (19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]].
*On 30/6/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/6/2023)|maintenance break]], increased the maximum number of Evolved Skeletons to 8 (from 6).
*On 8/8/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(8/8/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the cycles required to 2 (from 3) and decreased the maximum number of Evolved Skeletons to 6 (from 8).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the maximum number of Evolved Skeletons to 8 (from 6).
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor%20Update%20(13/11/2023)|Minor Update]], decreased the Evolved Skeletons’ first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
2024
*On 18/3/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops Update (18/3/2024)|Lucky Drops Update]], made it so that Evolved Skeletons would multiply after attacking instead of simultaneously.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Skeletons’ first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Skeletons after death.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the number of Evolved Skeletons spawned to 3 (from 4).
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Evolved Skeletons.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Evolved Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds).

